---
args: {"needs": "ReuseNeed[]", "events": "Evidence[]"}
returns: "FunctionalNeed[]"
---
Translate each requested product into the function it must perform, retaining recipient-confirmed essential behavior and tolerances. Separate preferred form from hard properties and allowed adaptation. Ask the recipient to confirm constraints that determine consequential suitability. Where only an event describes a need, retain it as a provisional need with missing identity/confirmation rather than inventing a complete recipient record.
